<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>

<!--
	Choices that follow the model while they are displayed.
	
	The left pane lists the appointment categories with commands to create and delete one, the middle
	pane the appointments. The right pane offers a category in two ways: a <value-input> of the
	category type without an options expression, and the form field of the reference
	Appointment#category of the appointment selected in the middle. A category created or
	deleted on the left is offered respectively no longer offered by both at once, without a new
	login - also while the form is being edited.
-->
<view>
	<channels>
		<channel name="model"/>
		<channel name="category"/>
		<channel name="chosenCategory"/>
		<channel name="appointment"/>
	</channels>
	<split-panel
		orientation="horizontal"
		resizable="true"
	>
		<panes>
			<pane
				size="30"
				unit="%"
			>
				<panel>
					<title>
						<en>Categories</en>
						<de>Kategorien</de>
					</title>
					<commands>
						<generic-command
							image="css:bi bi-plus-lg"
							placement="TOOLBAR"
						>
							<label>
								<en>New category</en>
								<de>Neue Kategorie</de>
							</label>
							<create-transient type="demo.calendar:AppointmentCategory">
								<with-result>
									<open-dialog
										bind-input-to="model"
										dialog-view="demo/create-appointment-category.view.xml"
									>
										<bind
											channel="selection"
											to="category"
										/>
									</open-dialog>
								</with-result>
							</create-transient>
						</generic-command>
						<generic-command
							image="css:bi bi-trash"
							inputs="category"
							placement="TOOLBAR"
						>
							<label>
								<en>Delete</en>
								<de>Löschen</de>
							</label>
							<executability>
								<null-input-disabled/>
							</executability>
							<delete-object/>
							<write-channel name="category"
								clear="true"
							/>
						</generic-command>
					</commands>
					<table
						observed-types="demo.calendar:AppointmentCategory"
						selection="category"
						types="demo.calendar:AppointmentCategory"
					>
						<columns>
							<column
								attribute="name"
								sort="ASC"
							/>
							<column attribute="color"/>
						</columns>
						<rows>all(`demo.calendar:AppointmentCategory`)</rows>
					</table>
				</panel>
			</pane>
			<pane
				size="30"
				unit="%"
			>
				<panel>
					<title>
						<en>Appointments</en>
						<de>Termine</de>
					</title>
					<table
						observed-types="demo.calendar:Appointment"
						selection="appointment"
						types="demo.calendar:Appointment"
					>
						<columns>
							<column attribute="name"/>
							<column
								attribute="start"
								sort="ASC"
							/>
						</columns>
						<rows>all(`demo.calendar:Appointment`)</rows>
					</table>
				</panel>
			</pane>
			<pane
				size="40"
				unit="%"
			>
				<stack
					direction="column"
					gap="default"
				>
					<panel with-inset="true">
						<title>
							<en>Choose a category</en>
							<de>Kategorie auswählen</de>
						</title>
						<text>
							<label>
								<en>Create a category on the left with "New category", then open the selection below: the new category is there right away, without logging in again. Delete it on the left and it is gone from the selection just as quickly.</en>
								<de>Legen Sie links mit „Neue Kategorie“ eine Kategorie an und öffnen Sie dann die Auswahl unten: Die neue Kategorie steht sofort zur Auswahl, ohne neue Anmeldung. Löschen Sie sie links wieder, ist sie ebenso schnell aus der Auswahl verschwunden.</de>
							</label>
						</text>
						<fields max-columns="1">
							<value-input
								type="demo.calendar:AppointmentCategory"
								value="chosenCategory"
							>
								<label>
									<en>Category</en>
									<de>Kategorie</de>
								</label>
							</value-input>
						</fields>
					</panel>
					<panel with-inset="true">
						<title>
							<en>Edit an appointment</en>
							<de>Termin bearbeiten</de>
						</title>
						<text>
							<label>
								<en>Click an appointment in the table "Appointments"; its form appears below. Click "Edit" and, while the form is open, create a category on the left: you can pick it in the form's "Category" field right away. (If there is no appointment yet, create one in the calendar demo first.)</en>
								<de>Klicken Sie in der Tabelle „Termine“ auf einen Termin; darunter erscheint sein Formular. Klicken Sie auf „Bearbeiten“ und legen Sie, während das Formular offen ist, links eine Kategorie an: Sie können sie sofort im Feld „Kategorie“ des Formulars auswählen. (Gibt es noch keinen Termin, legen Sie zuerst in der Kalender-Demo einen an.)</de>
							</label>
						</text>
						<form
							input="appointment"
							max-columns="1"
						>
							<field attribute="name"/>
							<field attribute="category"/>
						</form>
					</panel>
				</stack>
			</pane>
		</panes>
	</split-panel>
</view>